+     * @param dashboardTemplate the dashboard template content using Velocity syntax
+     * @return the rendered HTML string
+     * @throws IllegalArgumentException if userId or dashboardTemplate is null or empty
+     * @throws RuntimeException         if template parsing or rendering fails
